WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Jamie guards the opening crouching light punch in Burnout.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.450
Crouching medium punch catches Jamie’s attempted response.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:01.900
A second crouching medium punch links after the counter hit.

4
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.800
Medium Power Charge launches the confirmed medium chain.

5
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.750
Medium Rising Tackle finishes the juggle.
